  "content": "<div>\n<div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4zVxJZnJ9iM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></span></div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paulevsGitch/BCLib/main/bclib_banner.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kYuATbYbKW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111370.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterEnd/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/25/25231.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fquiqueck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.buymeacoffee.com/buttons/v2/default-yellow.png\" alt=\"Buy Me A Coffee\" width=\"217\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></p>\n<p>该模组在末地增加了新的生物群系，并修改了原有的生物群系。每个生物群系都有其独特的气氛、资源和怪物。天空将拥有紫色的星云和星星等自定义外观。所有生物群系都有独特的音乐、音效和效果，使其充满生机，令人探索欲增强。BetterEnd 提供了自定义末地生成器和中央岛屿的自定义结构。随着新生成器的加入，岛屿将拥有不同的形状、地形，并且处于不同的高度。在岛屿内部你可以发现蕴藏稀有资源的洞穴。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特色功能：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>24+种新的生物群系（后续还会添加更多）</li>\n<li>6种新生物（部分拥有生物群系变体）</li>\n<li>大量新方块，包含9种木材类型和7种新的石头类型</li>\n<li>大量新物品，包含新的食物来源、工具、盔甲和武器</li>\n<li>新机制如 infusion rituals、铁砧配方、末地工具进阶系统等</li>\n<li>与其他模组的整合，例如为BYG生物群系（1.16）新增2个子生物群系，并为它们添加一些新植物</li>\n<li>自定义末地世界生成器（可配置），比原版提供更多内容</li>\n<li>多种可配置项：包括方块、物品、怪物、附魔及更多内容</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>截图：</strong></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/317/161/2020-10-17_10.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/317/879/2020-10-21_17.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/330/861/2020-12-28_17.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/328/798/2020-12-20_21.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/324/921/2020-11-27_20.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/328/795/2020-12-20_21.png\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>评测：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/97_AjrikgpE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VEkIKbwwmB0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>整合内容：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/282/25/64/64/637287701215436754.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/canvas-renderer\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/197/845/64/64/636895665884150904.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/283/385/64/64/637292980729992711.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/281/230/64/64/637284761944802812.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colored-lights-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/392/890/64/64/637587622695448568.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>我们的其他模组：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/471/575/64/64/637760294980874674.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/396/271/64/64/637595638220205053.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infgen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/271/438/64/64/637248195374592724.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skyworld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/265/428/64/64/637229325539187031.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eden-ring\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/528/386/64/64/637851066965542722.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wunderreich\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/521/221/64/64/637840028913935424.jpeg\"></a></p>",
